    kind: invariant  # 9b3c
    title: "dead-code-maybe --seeds entrypoints (default) reports 89.5% dead-code rate on hypergumbo self-analysis"  # 9b3c
    status: violated  # 9b3c
    priority: 2  # 9b3c
    parent:  # 9b3c
    tags:  # 9b3c
    - dogfooding  # 9b3c
